==Event Information==
Brilliant! The Battle Cats has reached {{Color|#FF00FF|'''41 Million Downloads'''}} Worldwide!<br>
Time to celebrate!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between March 11th (11:00am) and 25th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Dark Descent Stages appear!'''}}<br>
A flood of shadowy evildoers invade The Battle Cats! Are you tough enough to stand against the fearsome challenge called the Dark Descent?!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent'''}}<br>
March 11th (11:00) thru March 25th (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent II'''}}<br>
March 12th (11:00) thru March 25th (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent III'''}}<br>
March 13th (11:00) thru March 25th (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent ∞'''}}<br>
March 14th (11:00) thru March 25th (10:59)!<br>
The Cat Empire needs YOU to take on this tough challenge! Don't let us down!<br>
※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festival, On Now!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days （3/11, 3/13, 3/15, 3/17, 3/19, 3/21, 3/23、3/25）'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}}, and on {{Color|#008000|'''even days (3/12, 3/14, 3/16, 3/18, 3/20, 3/22, 3/24)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''3/13, 3/16, 3/19, 3/22, and 3/25'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

